# Copy to .env and fill in what you need. .env is gitignored — never
# commit real values.
#
# This stack has no non-secret vars to interpolate anywhere, so there is
# nothing to put in .env today. Secrets (frontier provider keys,
# EXA_API_KEY, GITHUB_TOKEN, etc.) are never read from .env: pass them via
# a repeatable `--secret NAME=VALUE` launcher flag, or by exporting a
# `PI_SANDBOX__SECRET__<NAME>` env var on the host before launching. The
# launcher never retrieves or decrypts secrets itself — it only injects
# already-decrypted values.
#
# OAuth credentials are handled by `nix run .#login`, not via this file.
